stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Analysing : photo chosen
    Analysing --> Ready : result received
    Analysing --> Error : bad image or server error
    Error --> Idle : choose another photo
    Ready --> Playing : tap Play
    Playing --> Ready : pattern finished
    Ready --> Comparing : compare mode on
    Comparing --> Ready : compare mode off
    Ready --> Analysing : new photo chosen
    Ready --> [*] : page closed
